 "headline": "Hunter And Tre Jones Rescue Two Managers",
 "notes": [
  "theInfamous just stole 3PT% and steals from Gopher Gold, and Jayson Tatum's 3 STL are doing the pickpocketing while Gopher Gold watches.",
  "Giannis Antetokounmpo has 20 PTS and 16 REB so far, and Zero Fox Given still gave up FG% to Suggs to be you.",
