  "Nobody is benched and producing tonight, so every manager's lineup is clean for once. The only crime is the starters they chose.",
  "Paul George and Pascal Siakam are a combined 2-14 from the field, and BrookynDynasty is somehow up 8-3 anyway."
 ],
